Z||000000||My7Fieros||08-11-2001||09:20 PM||||Ok Ive been thinking about this for a while now, but Im gonna need some help on this one.<BR>If there was a Pennocks soap opera on tv, here would be some of the characters and their descriptions: (read the entire thing as one continous sentence per say..I mean, each characters name is completling the previous ones sentence. (i.e. Cliff Pennock- likes to be entertained by Songman, who is almost as good looking as My7..blah blah..youll see).<P><B>Cliff Pennock</B>- The head honcho...but a voice on the phone only, never being seen. Kind of like Charlie on Charlies Angels. Likes to be entertained by...<P><B>Songman</B>-The wealty Texan (I know, but for the sake of the show)...nice guy, easy to get along with. Sings from time to time to entertain the others. Charms the ladies, and almost as good looking as...<P><B>My7Fieros</B>-     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Uptight by the book local cop who loves his job but loves to have fun to. Tries to keep order within the Pennocks community. Married to...<P><B>FieroLisa</B>- Once married to another member of the Pennocks community until falling madly in love w/ the cop. (     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ) Always there to livin' up the party. A friend to all. Knows almost as much about Fieros as...<P><B>TheOgre</B>- Strange mystical all knowing creature that dwells beneath Lake Pennock. Rarely seen, but often heard, especially when a Fiero crisis is involved! Favorite show is Ren and....<P><B>Stimpy</B>- Always there to "set the tone" for the day. Never holds back his feelings and opinions (and everyone likes that). The "comic relief" of the show. Loves the readings of...<P><B>JSocha</B>- Die hard conservative, much like My7, only a bit more vocal. Stands tall for his beliefs...loves to debate with..<P><B>EdsB52</B>- Local attorney who represents people who cant handle the simple things in life most of us take for granted (like working a toaster). Die hard liberal, he stands firm with his beliefs. Shows his emotions from time to time, almost like...<P><B>Fierokid87 and Fierobaby</B>...local teenage couple who are rarely heard saying anything other than "I love you" to each other. Rarely seen also, usually hiding off somewhere making out.<P>Ok, thats all I can think of now....anybody else wanna join?   This <I>could</I> get interesting!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I><P>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 08-11-2001).]<P>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 08-11-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by My7Fieros (edited 08-11-2001).]||||reg||10
