Z||000066||Urchin||08-12-2001||09:44 AM||||"I am going to follow him from now on. Every attempt he makes to start arguments for no reason, I will be there." - FieroBritney<P><BR>Well I for one am going to sleep much better knowing this.  Hypathetically speaking, if Ed is so bad, what makes you think you are any better.  It took you six or seven posts in order to get a responce from Ed.  Now, one would have been sufficient.  The only thing you have accomplished in my eyes, is making yourself look immature.  The amusing thing is that people like you actually think you are "saving" us from Ed, but in reality you are only making things worse.  Ed is not the one currently causing trouble... you are.  And as I had stated in another post, now a lighthearted thread has turned into a shin kicking contest.  Cliff made the decision to leave this forum running, but I think if anything were to change his mind, it would be the useless (yes, useless) crap you are spewing, and yet you view yourself as a hero.  Not to mention the fact that you are well out of your league when it comes to showing up Ed.  That much is obvious.  And, haven't you noticed that most of us are either ignoring you or telling you to knock it off?  Take the hint, or take it to email.<P>My apologies to everyone for posting this here.  I was going to email it but unfortunately his/her email is not posted.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/new_3.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
