Z||000071||California Kid||08-12-2001||11:30 AM||||And the story goes on......Maryjane was so confused about what was happening in the little town of "Forum".  She decided to take a drive into the country with her Fiero and have some fun on the twisty roads outside of town.  As she came over one hill in the road she was blinded by bright lights and had to jamb on the brakes. As soon as the car stopped, two aliens flashed a blue light at her and she couldn't move. One alien carried her into the space ship while the other drove her Fiero in behind them, and the ship took off with a mild pulsing hum.<P>Turns out the aliens had intercepted this string, were very curious on who the characters were in the little town of Forum, and decided to get one of them for questioning.  When they found out all they could from her, they made some interesting changes to her Fiero that were not visible to the eye. They brought her back to the place where they picked her up and told her to be careful, the car would be very fast, some of the engine internals were replaced by a very small nuclear engine with a 25 year fuel pill. She started the car, said goodbye to the aliens, floored the gas pedal, and the Fiero must have accelerated from 0 to 60 in 1 second!!!<P>Meanwhile, Anniel and Hugh happen to meet at the local coffee shop and share a table on this sunny Sunday morning. Hugh finds out that Anniel is a Physiatrist in the city of Forum and has some very interesting patients. As they sit there discussing the small town gossip, Songman enters and takes a table next to theirs. He hears them speak of a couple people he knows and decides to join the conversation.........||||reg||6
